From b07e671afd3a524297561b60adab72267706632d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 08:48:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kasir): iOS-style header, category filter sheet, 2/3
 grid toggle (persisted), animated search bar

- New IosPageHeader on Kasir screen (was a plain bordered header)
- Toolbar order: Filter -> Grid toggle -> Search, right-aligned circular
  buttons; category chips row removed entirely, filter now lives in a
  bottom sheet (CategoryFilterSheet) reached via the filter icon, with
  a small active-filter badge dot when a category is selected
- Grid column count (2 or 3) toggled via the grid icon; persisted across
  app restarts through a new KasirGridColumnsController backed by
  shared_preferences (added as a new dependency in pubspec.yaml) -- a
  pure UI preference, not app/business data, so it intentionally does
  not use the encrypted SQLite store or secure storage
- Search bar animates from a 44px circle into a full-width bar growing
  from the left edge; Filter and Grid icons collapse out of the way via
  AnimatedSize; a separate solid dark (AppColors.textPrimary) circular
  close button appears at the right once expanded, distinct from the
  bar's white surface, matching the approved reference screenshot
- Menu grid cards reworked: muted 4-shape (triangle/heart/circle/square)
  placeholder thumbnail standing in for a future product photo, price
  now shown as "<price> / <unit>" using MenuItem.unit, and a dark
  rounded qty badge shown when the item already has quantity in the
  cart (summed across any variant-distinct cart lines for that
  menuItemId) -- replaces the old plain restaurant icon + no-badge card.
  A compact variant (smaller paddings/radii/badge/font) is used at 3
  columns.

Note: not run through flutter analyze/pub get in this environment (no
Flutter/Dart SDK available here) -- please verify with
'flutter pub get && flutter analyze' before merging.
